<LegalPage title="Privacy policy" draft={false} description="JMS Accountant Staffing Ltd.’s privacy policy, for Accountant Staffing and Administrative Staffing.">
  <p>JMS Accountant Staffing Ltd., including its operating divisions Accountant Staffing and Administrative Staffing, is committed to protecting personally identifiable information of all applicants, contractors, employees, and clients that use its services.</p>
  <p>To express this commitment, employees of JMS that are privy to personal information are informed of their legal requirement, under the federal privacy act, to protect any personally identifiable information and to sign a confidentiality agreement. We have also designated a Privacy Officer who is responsible for ensuring compliance with this policy.</p>
  <p>We are a recruitment firm; we collect personal information that is necessary to provide recruitment services to our clients and not for any other reason. In registering with JMS, personal information that may be collected, and that falls under this policy, includes but is not limited to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Resumes submitted by applicants, contractors, and employees</li>
    <li>Contact information</li>
    <li>Education records</li>
    <li>Employment history</li>
    <li>Professional training, certifications, and designations</li>
    <li>References from third parties named by applicants, as well as reference letters</li>
    <li>Skill testing results</li>
    <li>Interview notes</li>
    <li>Background check results</li>
    <li>Social Insurance Number (S.I.N.)</li>
    <li>Date of birth</li>
    <li>Banking information</li>
    <li>Any other information listed in an employment form</li>
  </ul>
  <p>All individuals, when registering with JMS, are required to sign a consent form. This permits the collection of personal information, as outlined above, that is necessary in order for JMS to render its services. Information may be collected in person, over the phone, or by corresponding via email with one of our consultants or staff.</p>
  <p>When we consider an individual to be a suitable candidate for a vacancy with one of our clients, the individual’s consent will be sought before sending their personal information to the client. We may disclose information to third-party companies and/or individuals we utilize to perform business functions and services on our behalf. These functions and services may include, but are not limited to: legal, accounting/payroll, marketing services, web server hosting, and data analysis. Unless required by law or for reasons of security, JMS will not disclose personal information for any new purpose without first seeking the consent of the individual. An individual may withdraw their consent at any time through written notification to JMS. We will notify the individual of the implications of withdrawing consent.</p>
  <p>Personal information shall be retained only as long as necessary for the fulfillment of those purposes for which it was collected. We will destroy personal information in a secure manner when the information is no longer required. In order to protect personal information, we have organizational and technological measures in place. Organizationally, we ensure that only those employees who need to access personally identifiable information in order to perform a specific job are permitted access. Technologically, we have password-protected computers, and the server on which personally identifiable information is stored is kept in a secure environment.</p>
  <p>We will make every effort to ensure that personal information is as accurate and complete as possible. Individuals are expected to update JMS on any changes to their personal information.</p>
  <p>We will provide further information about our policy or practices upon request. Any inquiries can be directed to JMS’ Privacy Officer, whose contact information is noted below. If changes are made to this privacy policy, they will be posted here on the website for the review of any interested party.</p>
  <p>Privacy Officer<br />JMS Accountant Staffing Limited<br /><a href="mailto:info@accountantstaffing.com">info@accountantstaffing.com</a><br />99 Wyse Road, Suite 1320<br />Dartmouth, Nova Scotia B3A 4S5</p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>What this website collects, its cookies and analytics are on our <a href={url('/privacy/')}>website privacy notice</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
